  "limitations": ["The validated row covers dense, uncompressed, normalized, nonnegative feature-by-sample matrices on macOS arm64. It removes all-zero and zero-variance features, but does not impute missing values, transform negative values, choose normalization, correct batches, infer supervised classes, estimate uncertainty across biological resampling, or assign biological names. Runtime and memory scale with matrix size, candidate ranks, and restarts; resource provisioning remains outside plugin scope."],
